    "q-143746": {
      "dom_id": "step-q143746",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14274884/assets/3c45364ee569d9ee24bbac167ad2a76f8a0a1a519f6604b7f9427d723c59abab.png)\n\nLet $X$ and $Y$ be continuous random variables with the joint probability density function \n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\{\\begin{aligned}6y{e}^{-3x}, & (x,y)\\in D, \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf $F(x,y)$ is the joint CDF of $X$ and $Y,$ find $F(\\frac{1}{3},\\frac{4}{3}).$",
      "worked_solution": "If $X$ and $Y$ are continuous random variables with the joint probability density function $f(x,y),$ then the corresponding joint CDF is given by\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=P(X\\le x,Y\\le y)={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{y}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{x}f(u,v)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v.\n$$\n\nLet's draw the point $(\\frac{1}{3},\\frac{4}{3})$ on our diagram. Let's also consider the region $Δ$ that lies below and to the left of this point.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14274884/assets/fbd92a584940df6ed6224a2ff0f1546e53786657012a997395d30d9248bfd528.png)\n\nUsing the definition of the joint CDF, we have\n\n$$\nF(\\frac{1}{3},\\frac{4}{3})=P(X<\\frac{1}{3},Y<\\frac{4}{3})={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{4/3}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{1/3}f(u,v)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v.\n$$\n\nFor the purposes of computation, we're only interested in the region inside $Δ$ where $f(x,y)$ is nonzero. This is given by\n\n$$\nD\\cap Δ=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le \\frac{1}{3},\\,0\\le y\\le 1\\}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{4/3}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{1/3}f(u,v)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1/3}6v{e}^{-3u}\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[-2v{e}^{-3u}]}_{u=0}^{u=1/3}\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(2v-2v{e}^{-1})\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}2(1-{e}^{-1})v\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =(1-{e}^{-1}){[{v}^{2}]}_{v=0}^{v=1} \\\\  & =(1-{e}^{-1}) \\\\  & =1-\\frac{1}{e}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-143746-a",
