    "q-143618": {
      "dom_id": "step-q143618",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14274884/assets/483c019e9c68f857379192d2b40ab84803c4360ca4e0158adc0a8a3bc1636c4e.png)\n\nLet $X$ and $Y$ be continuous random variables with the joint probability density function \n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+\\frac{8}{9}xy, & (x,y)\\in D, \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf $F(x,y)$ is the joint CDF of $X$ and $Y,$ find $F(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2}).$",
      "worked_solution": "If $X$ and $Y$ are continuous random variables with the joint probability density function $f(x,y),$ then the corresponding joint CDF is given by\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=P(X\\le x,Y\\le y)={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{y}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{x}f(u,v)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v.\n$$\n\nLet's draw the point $(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2})$ on our diagram. Let's also consider the region $Δ$ that lies below and to the left of this point.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14274884/assets/ffba85fc6ae71a1a5c250a90d686e8852c77756eebd228f3d3a2a9622cba01e1.png)\n\nUsing the definition of the joint CDF, we have\n\n$$\nF(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2})=P(X<\\frac{1}{2},Y<\\frac{1}{2})={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{1/2}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{1/2}f(u,v)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v.\n$$\n\nHowever, $f(u,v)$ is zero everywhere inside the region $Δ.$ Therefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{1/2}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{1/2}f(u,v)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-143618-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{1}{4}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"104\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-143618-b",
